000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          TUSAVGUP.
000400 AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        APRIL, 1982.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.  THIS IS THE MONTHY AVERAGE USAGE UPDATE OF MSTORERM
001000*          PROGRAM.
001100*
001200*    THIS PROGRAM RUNS ON THE FIRST WORKING DAY OF EACH
001300*    MONTH, AND UPDATES THE "STR-MTH-FCST" FIGURE IN THE
001400*    "MSTORERM" DATASET ("STORES" DATABASE) FROM THE USAGE
001500*    DATA IN "USAGEFIL".  IT IS STREAMED OUT OF THE JOB
001600*    "BCUTOFF" IF THE JCW "MONTHEND" IS SET TO 1 BY THE
001700*    PROGRAM "XUSEUPDT".  CIH.
001800*
      *C   07MAR1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C   09/12/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C     EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C     INCLUDE CENTURY ON CURRENT YEAR AND ADD TO
      *C     STOCK YEAR TO COMPUTE TOTAL MONTHS IN STOCK.
      *C   09/30/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C     WHEN CALCULATING THE NUMBER OF IN STOCK MONTHS,
      *C     IF THE NUMBER OF MONTHS IS LESS THAN 0 THEN
      *C     USE 12 AS THE NUMBER OF MONTHS.  THIS CAN HAPPEN
      *C     IF THE INIT DATE IS NOT NUMERIC AND THE DATE
      *C     IS SET TO 000000.
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C
DP2230*C  23FEB2000   DAVE PLUM
DP2230*C     ADDED LOGIC TO SPECIFY THAT "IN STOCK MONTHS" WILL BE
DP2230*C     SET TO 12 WHENEVER STR-INIT-DATE IS NOT NUMERIC
DP2230*C     (IT MAY BE EQUAL TO SPACES IN SOME CASES).  FOR THE
DP2230*C     YEAR 2000, THE COMPUTATION WAS RESULTING IN AN IN
DP2230*C     STOCK MONTHS VALUE EQUAL TO THE CURRENT MONTH.  FOR
DP2230*C     EXAMPLE, IN FEBRUARY 2000 AN ITEM WITH A STR-INIT-DATE
DP2230*C     OF SPACES WOULD HAVE AN IN-STOCK-MONTHS VALUE OF 2.
      *C
002000 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002100 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002200 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002300 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MSTORERM-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT USAGEFIL-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCSUSAG
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

002400 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MSTORERM-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MSTORERM-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0200  OF MCFLCS0201.

       FD  USAGEFIL-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  USAGEFIL-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCSUSAG  OF MCFLCSUSAG.
002500
002600 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002700
002800 77  SUB                           PIC S9(2) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
002900 77  UPDATE-CNT                    PIC 9(5)  VALUE 0.
003000 77  CURRENT-MM                    PIC S9(2) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
003200 77  ADD-TS-MM                     PIC S9(2) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
003400 77  IN-STOCK-MONTHS               PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
003500 77  TOTAL-USAGE                   PIC S9(8) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
003600 77  AVG-USAGE                     PIC S9(8) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
       77  MCXCBLERR-SCOPE               PIC X(1)  VALUE "C".

       01  CURRENT-YR                   PIC 9(4).
       01  FILLER REDEFINES CURRENT-YR.
           05  CURRENT-CC               PIC 9(2).
           05  CURRENT-YY               PIC 9(2).

       01  ADD-TS-YR                  PIC 9(4).
       01  FILLER REDEFINES ADD-TS-YR.
           05  ADD-TS-CC                PIC 9(2).
           05  ADD-TS-YY                PIC 9(2).
003700
003800 01  MDY-WORK.
003900     05  MM-WORK                   PIC 99.
004000     05  FILLER                    PIC X.
004100     05  DD-WORK                   PIC 99.
004200     05  FILLER                    PIC X.
004300     05  YY-WORK                   PIC 99.
004400
004500 01  YMD-WORK.
004600     05  YY                       PIC 9(2).
004700     05  MM                       PIC 9(2).
004800     05  DD                       PIC 9(2).
004900
005000*************************************************************
005100**                                                          **
005200**          C O M M U N I C A T I O N S   A R E A S         **
005300**                                                          **
005400**************************************************************
005500
005600 COPY TBLOWUP    IN COPYLIB.
005700
      *****************************************************************
      **                                                             **
      **          K S A M   W O R K                                  **
      **                                                             **
      *****************************************************************
006400 01  KEY-VALUE                     PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.
007000 01  USAGE-REC.
007100     05  FILLER                   PIC XX.
007200     05  K-CORP-CODE              PIC X(8).
007300     05  K-MONTHS                 OCCURS 14 TIMES.
007400         10  K-MTH-USAGE          PIC S9(9) COMP-4.
007300     05  K-MONTHS-DD              OCCURS 14 TIMES.
007400         10  K-MTH-USAGE-DD       PIC S9(9) COMP-4.
007500
008700**************************************************************
008800**                                                          **
008900**            D A T A B A S E   W O R K                     **
009000**                                                          **
009100**************************************************************
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".
009200
009300 01  BASE                       PIC X(10) VALUE "  STORES;".
009400 01  PASSWORD                   PIC X(5)  VALUE "JADE;".
009500
009600 COPY DBSTAT     IN COPYLIB.
009700 01  DSET-MSTORERM                 PIC X(16) VALUE "MSTORERM;".
009800
009900 01  MODE-AREA.
010000     05  MODE1                     PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 1.
010100     05  MODE2                     PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 2.
010200     05  MODE3                     PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 3.
010300     05  MODE5                     PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 5.
010400     05  MODE7                     PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 7.
010500
010600 01  ALL-ITEMS                 PIC X(2)  VALUE "@;".
010700
010800 01  CODE-ARG                      PIC X(8).
010900
011900**************************************************************
012000**                                                          **
012100**           D A T A B A S E   B U F F E R S                **
012200**                                                          **
012300**************************************************************
012400
012500 COPY MSTORERM   IN COPYLIB.
012600
012700 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
012800 1000-HOUSEKEEP SECTION.
012900 1100-BEGIN-HOUSEKEEP.
           MOVE "C" TO MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.
           CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.

           OPEN I-O MSTORERM-O.
           OPEN INPUT USAGEFIL-I.
013000
013100     DISPLAY "* BEGINNING AVERAGE USAGE UPDATE PGM *".
013200
014300     ACCEPT YMD-WORK FROM DATE.
014400
014500     PERFORM 6000-UPDATE-MSTORERM THRU 6990-UM-X.
014600
014700 2000-EOJ.
           CLOSE MSTORERM-O, USAGEFIL-I.
014800     DISPLAY "* END OF AVERAGE USAGE UPDATE PGM *".
014900
015200     GOBACK.
015300
015400 2100-BLOWUP.
015500     MOVE "TUSAVGUP"               TO   BU-PGM-NAME.
015600     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE BU-PGM-NAME STATUS-AREA
015700       DUMMY-VIEW-AREA FILE-STATUS BU-DISPLAY-MSG
015800       BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
015900
016000 6000-UPDATE-MSTORERM.
016100
016200**********************************************************
016300**   MOVE CURRENT MONTH & YEAR TO A COMP HOLD-AREA FOR  **
016400**   USE IN COMPUTING # OF MONTHS IN STOCK.  THIS IS    **
016500**   FOR NEW-MONTH PROCEDURE OF CALCULATION AVERAGE     **
016600**   USAGE TO UPDATE MSTORERM.                          **
016700*********************************************************
016800
016900     MOVE MM              TO  CURRENT-MM.
017000     MOVE YY              TO  CURRENT-YY.
      *-----COMPUTE CENTURY FOR CURRENT YEAR.
           IF CURRENT-YY > 70
               MOVE 19 TO CURRENT-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE 20 TO CURRENT-CC.
017100
           MOVE SPACES TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-O.
           START MSTORERM-O KEY > CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-O
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "START ERROR MSTORERM" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.
017300
017400 6100-SERIAL-READ.
017500*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-MSTORERM, MODE2, STATUS-AREA
017600*      ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MSTORERM, CODE-ARG.
           READ MSTORERM-O NEXT INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "1"
017800         GO TO 6990-UM-X
017900     ELSE
018000     IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
018100         MOVE "DBGET ERR 6100-SRL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
018200         PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.
018300
018400     MOVE CORP-CODE                TO   KEY-VALUE.
018500*    CALL "CKREADBYKEY" USING FILE-TABLE, KSAM-STATUS, USAGE-REC,
018600*      KEY-VALUE, KEY-LOC, RECSIZE.
           MOVE KEY-VALUE TO CORPCDE OF USAGEFIL-REC-I.
           READ USAGEFIL-I INTO USAGE-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
077400     IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
018800         DISPLAY "CODE ", CORP-CODE,
018900         "NOT FOUND FOR USAGE UPDATE"
019000         GO TO 6100-SERIAL-READ
019100     ELSE
019200     IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "0"
019300         MOVE "CKREADBYKEY ERR 6100-SRL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
019400         PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.
019500
019600     ADD 1 TO UPDATE-CNT.
019700
019800****************************************************
019900**   CALCULATE TOTAL USAGE FOR UPDATE OF          **
020000**   AVERAGE USAGE IN MSTORERM.                   **
020100****************************************************
020200
020300     MOVE 0 TO SUB, TOTAL-USAGE.
020400 6200-ADD-LOOP.
020500     ADD 1 TO SUB.
020600     IF SUB > 12
020700         GO TO 6300-COMPUTE-MONTHS.
020800
020900     ADD K-MTH-USAGE (SUB) TO TOTAL-USAGE.
021000
021100     GO TO 6200-ADD-LOOP.
021200
021300 6300-COMPUTE-MONTHS.
           IF STR-INIT-DATE NOT NUMERIC
               MOVE "000000"            TO  YMD-WORK
           ELSE
021400         MOVE STR-INIT-DATE       TO  YMD-WORK.
021500     MOVE MM                      TO  ADD-TS-MM.
021600     MOVE YY                      TO  ADD-TS-YY.
      *-----COMPUTE CENTURY FOR ADD TO STOCK DATE
           IF ADD-TS-YY > 70
               MOVE 19 TO ADD-TS-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE 20 TO ADD-TS-CC.
021700
      *-----INCLUDE CENTURY TO COMPUTE IN STOCK MONTHS
021800     COMPUTE IN-STOCK-MONTHS =
021900       (((CURRENT-YR - ADD-TS-YR) * 12) + CURRENT-MM) - ADD-TS-MM.

DP2330*****IF IN-STOCK-MONTHS > 12 OR < 0
DP2330
DP2330     IF (IN-STOCK-MONTHS > 12 OR < 0)
DP2330       OR (STR-INIT-DATE NOT NUMERIC)
022100         MOVE 12 TO IN-STOCK-MONTHS.
022200
022300     COMPUTE AVG-USAGE ROUNDED = TOTAL-USAGE / IN-STOCK-MONTHS.
022400
023100     MOVE AVG-USAGE  TO  STR-MTH-FCST.
023200*    CALL "DBUPDATE" USING BASE, DSET-MSTORERM, MODE1, STATUS-AREA,
023300*      ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MSTORERM.
           REWRITE MSTORERM-REC-O FROM BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
023500         MOVE "DBUPDATE ERR MSTORE 612-UAU" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
023600         PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.
023700
024400     GO TO 6100-SERIAL-READ.
024500
024600 6990-UM-X.
024700     EXIT.
